# The Bootstrap Utility API in Sass ⚙️

Bootstrap 5's utilities are generated from a Sass map in `_utilities.scss`. You can add, modify, or delete utilities by modifying `$utilities`:

```scss_not
@import 'bootstrap/scss/bootstrap';

// Add a custom opacity utility
$utilities: map-merge(
  $utilities, (
    'custom-opacity': (
      property: opacity,
      values: (
        0: 0,
        25: 0.25,
        50: 0.5,
        75: 0.75,
        100: 1,
      )
    )
  )
);
```

Generates `.opacity-0`, `.opacity-50`, etc. automatically with responsive variants!
